  "label": "Dishwasher Malfunction Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the common stereotype that household appliances, especially dishwashers, are prone to malfunctioning and causing frustration. This is a relatable domestic annoyance that people experience, often humorously exaggerated. The use of the expletive 'fucking' amplifies the frustration, which is a common way to express exasperation with inanimate objects that fail to perform as expected.",
